# Every text file is LF in the working tree, on every machine — including
# a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true (the GitHub-hosted runners,
# and this repo's own author). The source-scan audit tests in
# crates/dbc-ui/src/main.rs match "\n"-shaped patterns and were failing
# in CI on CRLF checkouts (2026-09-03).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows script: PowerShell is fine with LF, but keep it explicit.
*.ps1 text eol=lf

# Binaries: never touched.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
